## Featured Projects

### ✈️ Vayu Vihar — Helicopter Booking System
**Problem:** No streamlined, secure platform for helicopter booking with real-time user management.
**Solution:** A full-stack booking system with JWT-secured authentication, dynamic seat management, and API-driven booking workflows.
**Architecture:** React → REST API → Django / Flask → PostgreSQL
**Verified impact:** 500+ test bookings · zero auth vulnerabilities found · ~40% efficiency gain in the booking workflow

`Django` `Flask` `React` `JWT` `PostgreSQL`

[GitHub Repo](https://github.com/KRSaiVarun/vayu-vihar)

---

### 📊 DataInsight Hub Pro — Analytics Dashboard
**Problem:** Large datasets with slow, hard-to-read reports.
**Solution:** An interactive dashboard with optimized SQL queries and real-time visual data exploration across 50K+ records.
**Verified impact:** 45% improvement in query performance · ~25% faster decision-making

`Python` `Pandas` `SQL` `React`

[GitHub Repo](https://github.com/KRSaiVarun/datainsight-hub)

---

### 📄 PDF Analysis Tool — AI Document Processor
**Problem:** Manual PDF data extraction is slow and error-prone.
**Solution:** An AI-powered extraction pipeline using NLP for structured data parsing from unstructured PDFs.
**Verified impact:** 92% accuracy across 1,000+ documents · ~70% reduction in processing time

`Python` `NLP` `Scikit-learn` `Flask`

[GitHub Repo](https://github.com/KRSaiVarun/pdf-analysis-tool)

---

### 🔐 CyberScan Pro — Security Vulnerability Scanner
**Problem:** Developers lack accessible tools to audit their own apps for common vulnerabilities.
**Solution:** An automated scanner detecting 15+ common threat vectors with detailed, actionable report generation.

`Python` `Flask` `Security`

[GitHub Repo](https://github.com/KRSaiVarun/cyberscan-pro)

---

### 🧭 CareerNavigator — AI Career Recommendation Platform
**Problem:** Students struggle to identify the right career path from the options available to them.
**Solution:** An ML-powered recommendation engine that personalizes career suggestions based on skills and interests.
**Verified impact:** 85% user satisfaction in prototype testing

`Python` `Scikit-learn` `Flask`

[GitHub Repo](https://github.com/KRSaiVarun/careernavigator)

